# EHRI - KG Knowledge Graph Report

## Overview
The EHRI (European Holocaust Research Infrastructure) Knowledge Graph is a comprehensive archival knowledge graph focused on Holocaust-related documentation. It uses a single unified graph structure (no named graphs) and is built primarily on the Records in Contexts (RiC) ontology standard.

## Graph Statistics
- **Total Entity Types**: 23 distinct types
- **Total Properties**: 108 distinct properties
- **Scale**: Large-scale graph with over 870,000 triples

