## Sample Entity Analysis

### 1. Identifier Entity
**Sample**: <http://lod.ehri-project-test.eu/units/nl-002896-mf810876-mf811242/alternateIDs/1>
- **Properties**: 3 triples
- **Structure**: Simple identifier with textual value and relationship to record set
- **Key Properties**: 
  - <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#textualValue>: "NL-AsdNIOD/270c/400"
  - <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasIdentifierOf>: Links to record set

### 2. RecordSet Entity
**Sample**: <http://lod.ehri-project-test.eu/units/us-005578-irn500067-irn503032>
- **Properties**: 24 triples
- **Structure**: Rich archival description with multiple subjects, dates, and relationships
- **Key Properties**:
  - <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#title>: "Oral history interview with Arie Troitze"
  - <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#hasOrHadSubject>: Multiple subject links to camps, ghettos, terms, and persons
  - <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#hasOrHadHolder>: Links to institution
  - <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#recordResourceExtent>: "7 videocassettes (U-Matic), sound, color ; 3/4 in."
  - <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#scopeAndContent>: Detailed description
  - <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#conditionsOfAccess>: "No restrictions on access"

### 3. Activity Entity
**Sample**: <http://lod.ehri-project-test.eu/vocabularies/ehri-cb/005441/functions/1>
- **Properties**: 4 triples
- **Structure**: Activity with description and performer
- **Key Properties**:
  - <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#generalDescription>: Detailed Italian description of Union of Italian Jewish Communities
  - <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isOrWasPerformedBy>: Links to corporate body

### 4. Date Entity
**Sample**: <http://lod.ehri-project-test.eu/dates/1945>
- **Properties**: 1,856 triples (highly connected)
- **Structure**: Date entity linked to many record sets and corporate bodies
- **Key Properties**:
  - <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#isBeginningDateOf>: Links to numerous entities
  - Acts as a temporal hub connecting many archival resources

### 5. SKOS Concept Entity
**Sample**: <http://lod.ehri-project-test.eu/vocabularies/ehri-camps/3001>
- **Properties**: 7 triples
- **Structure**: Controlled vocabulary term with geographic and hierarchical information
- **Key Properties**:
  - <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel>: "Vivikonna OT concentration camp"
  - <http://www.w3.org/2003/01/geo/wgs84_pos#lat>: 59.338
  - <http://www.w3.org/2003/01/geo/wgs84_pos#long>: 27.6746
  - <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader>: Hierarchical relationship
  - <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso>: External link to Wikidata

### 6. CorporateBody Entity
